cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "liftmath"
abstract: >-
  A simple gym calculator: estimate a one-rep max from a weight x reps set,
  work out which plates to load for a target barbell weight, score relative
  strength across bodyweights with Wilks (original + 2020), DOTS, and IPF GL
  points, and look up records for powerlifting, strongman, grip sport, and
  track & field (world, US collegiate, and US high-school levels). Pure
  Python standard library, no runtime dependencies.
authors:
